---
const IBAN = 'ES69 3008 0084 3145 0192 0526'
---

<section class="bg-warm px-4 py-10 sm:py-14">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-xl rounded-2xl bg-[#605550] px-8 py-10 text-center" data-animate>
        <p class="font-serif text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#f5f0e8]">Regalo</p>
        <p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#f5f0e8]">
            Lo que de verdad nos importa es que pasemos un gran día junt@s.
            Si además queréis echarnos una mano...
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg border border-[#f5f0e8]/20 bg-[#f5f0e8]/10 px-5 py-3">
            <span class="font-mono text-sm tracking-wide text-[#f5f0e8]" id="iban-text">{IBAN}</span>
            <button id="copy-iban" class="text-[#f5f0e8]/60 transition hover:text-[#f5f0e8]" title="Copiar número de cuenta">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
                    <path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path>
                </svg>
            </button>
        </div>
        <p id="copy-msg" class="mt-2 hidden text-xs text-[#f5f0e8]">¡Copiado!</p>
    </div>
</section>

<script>
    document.getElementById('copy-iban')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        navigator.clipboard.writeText('ES6930080084314501920526')
        const msg = document.getElementById('copy-msg')
        msg.classList.remove('hidden')
        setTimeout(() => msg.classList.add('hidden'), 2000)
    })
</script>
